# Project agent rules

Before attempting any fix or change in this repository:

1. Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) at the project root.
2. Follow every rule in that file — especially **Rule 0: never touch production / never push**.
3. Work and verify **locally only**. This site has paying customers; outages are unacceptable.
4. Re-check your plan against those rules before editing files or running commands.

If your planned work would violate any rule in AGENTS.md, stop and ask the user first.
